I wanted to reproduce the example here: https://www.bioconductor.org/packages/devel/bioc/vignettes/ggtree/inst/doc/advanceTreeAnnotation.html under "Plot Tree with associated data". However, I could not find the facet_plot function and it doesn't seem to be included in ggplot2/ gtree anymore.

So I tried this:

library(ggtree)

tr <- rtree(30)

p1 <- ggtree(tr)
d1 <- data.frame(id=tr$tip.label, val=rnorm(30, sd=3))
